# Rust reference implementation: read as documentation, never part of this codebase's graph.
stump/

# .NET build output. Excluded via .gitignore as well, but stated here so the index does not
# depend on the ignore file staying that way: the .d.ts-equivalent artefacts under these
# directories fake references and break dead-code analysis.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Project and solution files: MSBuild plumbing, no call graph.
*.csproj
*.slnx
*.sln
*.props
*.targets

# Configuration values indexed as Variable nodes, which crowd out real symbols.
**/appsettings*.json
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

# EF Core scaffolding: generated from the model, thousands of lines that drown the entities
# they mirror. The DbContext is the source of truth.
**/Migrations/
